  "Number": 1,
  "Question": "The value of \\(\\left[2-3(2-3)^{-1}\\right]^{-1}\\) is:",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(5\\)",
    "B": "\\(-5\\)",
    "C": "\\(\\dfrac15\\)",
    "D": "\\(-\\dfrac15\\)",
    "E": "\\(\\dfrac53\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "An exponent of \\(-1\\) means the reciprocal of a nonzero number. First,\n\\[\n2-3=-1,\n\\qquad (2-3)^{-1}=\\frac1{-1}=-1.\n\\]\nTherefore\n\\[\n\\left[2-3(2-3)^{-1}\\right]^{-1}\n=\\left[2-3(-1)\\right]^{-1}\n=5^{-1}\n=\\frac15.\n\\]\nBoth reciprocal bases, \\(-1\\) and \\(5\\), are nonzero. The answer is \\(\\frac15\\), choice C.",
